    feat(api): invitation email in the Flowboard theme (B-12)
    
    The invitation email now uses the Flowboard look: a light header with the plum app icon
    (hosted on the app origin) and a plum wordmark, a white card on the warm canvas, a role
    badge, one accept button, a visible fallback link, the expiry line and a footer that says
    why the person received it. Table layout, 600px cap, inline styles, a hidden preheader,
    alt text and no external CSS or fonts. Every colour pair meets WCAG AA.
    
    Tests cover the structure fingerprint, inline-style rules, the link set, escaping of names
    containing markup, a one-line bounded subject, and contrast. A preview and 600px and 375px
    light renders are in docs/references/email. No dark-mode renders: headless Chrome cannot
    reproduce client dark mode.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

